 ("Main idea", "The main purpose of the passage is to:", ["explain why effortful study strategies like retrieval practice and spacing work better than rereading", "argue that students should study less", "describe the history of education research", "explain how to write a good essay"], "The passage compares rereading with retrieval practice and spacing."),
 ("Details", "According to the passage, in the typical experiment, students who practiced recalling the passage:", ["remembered more a week later even though they expected to do worse", "remembered less than the rereading group", "spent more time with the passage", "forgot everything within a day"], "Paragraph 2 describes these results."),
 ("Vocabulary in context", "As used in the passage, a \"desirable difficulty\" is:", ["a challenge that slows learning at first but makes it last", "a test that is too hard to pass", "a subject students enjoy", "a mistake in a study"], "The last paragraph defines it."),
